Bundled face models
-------------------
face_detection_yunet_2023mar_int8bq.onnx
    YuNet face detector — Shiqi Yu et al., via OpenCV Zoo (Apache-2.0 / MIT).
face_recognition_sface_2021dec_int8bq.onnx
    SFace face recogniser — Yaoyao Zhong et al., via OpenCV Zoo (Apache-2.0).
Both files were block-quantised to int8 with OpenCV Zoo's block_quantize.py.

